+# Tasks: Subscription Self-Service Management
+
+Traceable to `specs/spec.md` and `specs/plan.md`.
+
+## TASK-001: Add role-based action gating
+
+Implements REQ-001 and PLAN-001. Extend `OwnerRole` handling in `src/services/subscriptionService.ts` so owners and billing admins can act and viewers cannot.
+
+- Verifies AC-001: viewers see a read-only subscription view.
+
+## TASK-002: Build the charged-change confirmation flow
+
+Implements REQ-002, REQ-004, and PLAN-002. Add a confirmation step that shows plan, proration, and next renewal total before submitting an upgrade or seat increase through the provider.
+
+- Verifies AC-002: immediate upgrade with proration.
+- Verifies AC-005: price preview before any charge.
+
+## TASK-003: Implement downgrade credits and cancellation refunds
+
+Implements REQ-002, REQ-003, and PLAN-002. Apply downgrades immediately with unused-time credit, and immediate cancellation with a pro-rata refund through the provider.
+
+- Verifies AC-003: immediate downgrade credit.
+- Verifies AC-004: immediate cancellation refund.
+
+## TASK-004: Convert pendingChange into a change queue
+
+Implements REQ-005 and PLAN-003. Replace the single `pendingChange` field in `src/types.ts` with an ordered queue, surfaced in the UI with per-item removal before renewal.
+
+- Verifies AC-006: multiple queued changes with visible ordering.
+
+## TASK-005: Add provider error handling and automatic retry
+
+Implements REQ-006 and PLAN-004. Map provider errors into UI messages, keep failed changes queued, and auto-retry every 60 seconds.
+
+- Verifies AC-007: provider failure retry.
